<div id="u-credit-00375-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nirvana073" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6031220); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6031220&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607459142" alt="nirvana073" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6031220)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nirvana073" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6031220); return false;">nirvana073</a></span></p>
